    <string name="intro_aid_title">A communication aid</string>
    <string name="intro_aid_body">Sign Setu helps you talk with young children, deaf people and people who speak another language, using pictures, captions, recorded speech and gestures.\n\nIt is not an interpreter. For anything that will become a statement, call a qualified interpreter.</string>
    <string name="intro_private_title">Nothing leaves this phone</string>
    <string name="intro_private_body">The app has no internet access. Session records are encrypted with your screen lock, and deleted when the session ends or after 24 hours at most.\n\nA report leaves the phone only when you export and share it, and it is protected by a password you give separately.</string>
    <string name="intro_pinning_title">Turn on app pinning</string>
    <string name="intro_pinning_body">When you hand the phone over, Sign Setu pins itself so the person cannot open other apps.\n\nIn your phone\'s security settings, turn on App pinning and \"Ask for PIN before unpinning\".</string>
    <string name="key_reset_title">Earlier sessions were deleted</string>
    <string name="key_reset_body">The phone screen lock was removed or changed, so Android deleted the key that protected earlier session records. They could not be opened and have been deleted. New sessions work as normal.</string>
